      "widgets_values": [
        "## Flow PT — start here\n\nTwo halves, run one at a time.\n\n**Publish.** Pick a **project** and a **link** on the Publish node, then Run. It reads\n`example.png`, creates a Version in Flow PT, and the panel names it before you press anything.\n\n**Load.** Now pick the same project and link on the Load node and Run again. It reads back what you\njust published.\n\nNothing here needs a model, and nothing is written to disk: **Create Published Files** is off.\nTurn it on once your profile names a storage."
      ]
